pub const NOTE : str = "Guard is check-user-exists. A second, unregistered copy of this function exists in the tree (src/inngest_app/functions/morphImages.ts); the registered one is the file named in SERVICE. 2026-09-17: charges-balance removed from SIDE_EFFECTS -- the file imports getUserBalance only; check-balance reads the balance against a constant of 50 and nothing in the file deducts it, so the manifest and this spec overstated what the function does with money. deliver-result: video_url is a path on the worker written by concatenate-all-videos, not a URL; the code passed the bare string to sendVideo and sendDocument (read by Telegram as file_id or URL), fell into the catch and sent the user that same path as a download link while returning delivered. Now the file is streamed as { source }, and a failed delivery rethrows so the step is retried and, after RETRIES, onFailure tells the admin. Not verified: a live morph run; the paid Kling calls in process-all-pairs remain unmetered. Test: 999-multibots-telegraf src/__tests__/render/deliveryIsNotSwallowed.test.ts.";
